:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Atmos GIGA-B 32/230.1-5,5/2</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:113px 151px 183px 226px 302px 378px 453px 529px 604px 680px 756px 831px 907px 982px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">or equivalent)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">A meaningful data sheet of the pump offered with all relevant information on operating data, pump hydraulics, drive, efficiency and materials is to be enclosed with the bid!</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Supply pump and assemble ready for operation.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Motive pump [PERSON_110]</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id388" RNoPart="4"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">The pump according to the preceding item (motive pump [PERSON_110]) is to be installed before the concrete foundation for the pump is produced.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">To be offered is a sturdy base frame of steel sections / threaded rods acc. to [PERSON_125] of the bidder for the assembly of the pump approx. 50 cm above floor, suitable for subsequent grouting with concrete.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Securing in position by dowelling to the concrete floor.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_110]</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id226" RNoPart="5"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Drainage pump for wastewater</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Submersible pump with open impeller</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Single-phase AC motor</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Degree of protection IP 68</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">with [PERSON_078]</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> 10 m for fixed connection by others on site</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Control via level measurement provided by others on site</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Materials:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Pump casing: polypropylene</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Impeller:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">polypropylene/polyamide</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Motor casing:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">1.4301</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Sealing:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">SIC/SiC</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Impeller side: shaft sealing rings</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Mechanical seal motor side: shaft sealing ring</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Pumped material:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Wastewater (free of faeces, free</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">passage of pump min. 10 mm)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Delivery flow Q:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">11 m3/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Delivery head H:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">7,0 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Connected load: 	</span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'............'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> kW</span><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Starting method:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">direct</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Discharge nozzle:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.............'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> inch</span><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="13" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">make offered:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(e.g. Wilo or equivalent)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="14" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_129] offered:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">incl. all fastening and assembly accessories</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Installation location: </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Basement of machine house, pump sump</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">supply and assemble complete, including suitable transition to onward pressure line of [PERSON_115] press-fitting pipe, DN 50</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Basement drainage pump</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id227" RNoPart="02"><LblTx><p><span>[PERSON_066]</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Remark ID="id228"><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Description of execution high-performance - cross-flow aeration plant for physical deacidification</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">For designs that deviate from the following description, the equivalence is to be proven by meaningful documents (design description, data sheets).</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Cross-flow aeration plant or [PERSON_066] for the physical deacidification of drinking water in energy-optimised design.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">The carbonic acid is stripped out by fine-bubble air injection via ceramic elements of glass-bonded sintered material; Simple aerator cassette change by means of side pull-out and lateral opening elements.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Depending on the item text in single- or two-storey design; Entire apparatus ([PERSON_066]) executed gas-tight in pressure rating 3/6 acc. to DIN 24190 (+6500/-500 Pa); tightness class IV acc. to DIN EN 1507 with highest requirement, limit value of the air leakage rate class acc. to D DIN E1507 &lt; 0,006 cm³/min; The gas-tightness is to be proven to the client on request;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Complete apparatus described below manufactured as sheet metal construction, in predominantly folded and bolted design, welding stresses are to be minimised, therefore all housing stiffeners are to be connected to the sheet metal construction in a force-locking manner without welding; Minimum material thickness for the entire construction 3 mm; All steel parts in stainless [PERSON_089] with the material no. 1.4571, manufactured in ferrite-free rooms and pickled and passivated in a full bath after processing; Packed in foil at the factory and assembled with foil;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">All bolted connections (e.g. cover bolting) that cannot be executed as through-bolting are to be made with easily replaceable thread inserts, i.e. threaded holes in sheet metal parts are not permitted; The aeration plant is built up Modular; The modules connected in series (train) are connected horizontally by means of rectangular flange; In order to ensure permanent tightness between the modules, a sealing system is used that is able to decouple the weight forces to be transmitted from the required sealing forces, i.e. a force-locking connection between the metals is made; This sealing system (called connection adapter with sealing device in the following) is clamped in each case between the modules to be connected and consists of one solid rectangular flange each with corresponding connection threads as well as O-ring seals worked in all round with a hardness of 40 Shore; The aeration elements must meet the requirements of the KTW and pass the tests for microbiological growth (DVGW worksheet W270); Housing and cover seals by means of profile seal with KTW and DVGW W270 approval with a minimum Shore hardness of 40°, in accordance with DIN53505 and DIN7868 (use of sealing compounds excluded); A detailed construction drawing of the complete [PERSON_066] is to be included in the prices and submitted to site management in good time before ordering for checking and approval; Due to the high energy efficiency required, all components are to be executed in highly flow-favourable optimised form; Compliance with all required max. pressure losses as well as listed dimensions must be strictly complied with and proven to site management on request in good time before delivery; The supplier must be able to prove references of plants of similar size and comparable energy balance that have been successfully commissioned.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Details of the KTW test certificate of the profile seal used for all housing seals</span></p><p style="text-indent:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="text-indent:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Issuing institute: 	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-left:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Test report no.:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">with the following further properties/equipment</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;">Water inlet/outlet part</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> (end module)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">For collecting and calming the even inflow of the incoming [PERSON_029] into the subsequent reaction part (inlet part); or for the even outflow of the aerated [PERSON_029] from the preceding reaction part; as sheet metal construction, design and tightness class as described above; For connection to the reaction module open on one side, with suitably worked-in, sturdy rectangular flange double-folded all round incl. connection adapter with sealing device to the reaction module; For controlling the optimum submergence of the aerator units, integrated linear guide device fitted towards the reaction part with mounted, height-adjustable overflow weir, designed for an adjustment range of +- 40 mm, positioning accuracy over the entire adjustment range +- 1 mm; Design and positioning of the overflow weir according to the existing hydraulic backwater; All connections external flange nozzles PN10 DIN2576 drilled; Required flange connections as well as further internals according to item text; </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;">Reaction module</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> (middle module)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Reaction module to accommodate two high-performance--aerator units each with associated air distribution system; Cuboid sheet metal construction with housing stiffeners located inside and fitted exclusively in flow direction, design and tightness class as described above; For connection to further reaction modules or end modules open on two sides, each with sturdy rectangular flange double-folded all round incl. connection adapter with sealing devices to accommodate the next modules; With two four-point quick-clamping devices fitted to the lower base plate for positioning the aerator units; Front opening for easy lateral pull-out of the aerator units; Opening with C-profile rectangular flange double-folded all round to accommodate a maintenance-friendly opening cover bolted gas-tight; In addition sturdy opening cover with all-round fold, worked-in seal as well as two handles; With inspection opening worked into the upper plate, cut-out in the housing plate for reasons of stability, appearance and injury protection with additionally screwed-on deburred stiffening frame; In addition sturdy inspection cover with all-round fold, worked-in seal and T-handle screws; connection adapters worked into the upper plate to accommodate the clamping device for the air distribution system;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">In order to ensure an unobstructed exhaust air flow, the minimum component dimensions stated in the detailed specification of the reaction modules, are to be observed; with residual drainage through external connection </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Installation kit for reaction module</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;">Four-part air distribution system</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> for connecting the process air to two high-performance aerator units in the reaction module; Distribution system manufactured from round pipe, completely in optimised flow-favourable design; Screwable gas-tight clamping device to accommodate the air distribution system, matching the connection adapter in the reaction module, ending with flange nozzles located outside on the reaction module;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;">High-performance aerator unit</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">, energy-optimised compact system for optimum gas exchange in the reaction module; Aerator unit with cylindrical aluminosilicate aerator candles; Pressed gas-tight symmetrically onto a flow-optimised distributor pipe; Distributor pipe with connection piece with integrated quick coupling for connection to the air distribution system; Distributor pipe with lateral centring devices to accommodate the flow-optimised inflow devices; Inflow devices for laminar inflow to the aerator candles with trumpet-shaped connection (Rmin=7) recessed into the distribution pipe with a max. offset of + -0,5mm; gas-tight pressing device with floating aerator candle bearing, executed so that the contact pressure of each aerator candle can be determined individually and manufacturing tolerances of the aerator candles can be compensated; The whole construction is to be executed so that an unobstructed inflow to the aerator candles takes place without internal narrowing of the cross-section by internals; An inner free cross-section of the aerator candles of D=40 mm is to be ensured throughout;  </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;">Note!</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> The fastening of the aerator candles by means of tie rods through the aerator candles, is not permitted for energy reasons; Likewise not permitted are centring devices that fall below a clear cross-section of D=40;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Details of the aerator candles</span></p><p style="text-indent:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Material: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">ceramic</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Outer diameter: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">70 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Inner diameter: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">40 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Specific permeability:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">10 to the power of -13 per m²</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Filter fineness for gases:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">5 µm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Porosity </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">40%</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="13" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_129]:			 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'...............................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(e.g. Aerolith AE S30 or equivalent)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="14" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Make:		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'...............................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(e.g. Pall or equivalent)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Details of the inflow devices:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Inner diameter: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">40 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"