"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="17" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Resistance coefficient:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(Zeta max. 0,03)</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_128] [PERSON_066]</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id229" RNoPart="1"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">High-performance- cross-flow aeration plant in single-storey design </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">acc. to [PERSON_128] including comprssor unit and base frame</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">completely manufactured, supplied and assembled ready for operation </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">All dimensions stated below are minimum dimensions (see [PERSON_128]).</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Design data: </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Water volume flow:</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Operating case Max: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">11 l/s (40 m³/h)</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">dissolved carbon di</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">oxide concentrations</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">in the inflow: 22 mg/l</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">in the outflow: 7 mg/l</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">pH value to be set</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">in the outflow:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">&gt;= 7,70</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dimension (approx.):</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Width 2300 mm; Depth: 1350 mm Height: 650 mm </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">consisting of:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;">1 piece inlet part</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">as described, but with the following further properties:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Component dimensions:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Width: 320 mm; Depth: 1350 mm Height: 650 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">additional internals:</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1x flange connection for raw water DN150</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Socket R=2" in the upper part</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1x threaded socket 1" in the lower base plate</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1x socket 1/2" for sampling</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1x all required seals, bolting and</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">connecting materials </span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 piece outlet module</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">as described but with the following further properties:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Component dimensions:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Width: 320 mm; Depth: 1350 mm Height: 650 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">additional internals:</span></p><p style="margin-left:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1x socket R=2" in the upper part</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1x flange connection for aerated [PERSON_029] DN150</span></p><p style="margin-left:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">1x threaded socket 1" for residual drainage in the lower</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> base plate</span></p><p style="margin-left:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">all required seals, bolting and connecting materials </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;">1 piece reaction module (middle module)</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">as described but with the following further properties:</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1x flange connection for exhaust air DN150</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2x flange connection for supply air</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">additional internals per reaction module:</span></p><p style="text-indent:20pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">front maintenance opening: 1456 mm x 526 mm</span></p><p style="text-indent:20pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">inspection opening in the upper plate: 290 mm x 290 mm</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="text-indent:19pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1x four-part air distribution system as described before; </span></p><p style="text-indent:19pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">max. permissible pressure loss of 1,9 mBar at 400 m³/h</span></p><p style="text-indent:19pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">for the entire system;</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="text-indent:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2x high-performance aerator unit as described before each with</span></p><p style="text-indent:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">8 aerator candles of 1000 mm each</span></p><p style="text-indent:19pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1x threaded socket 2" for residual drainage in the lower</span></p><p style="text-indent:19pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">base plate</span></p><p style="text-indent:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">2x process air connection DN100</span></p><p style="text-indent:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-left:15pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">all required seals, bolting and connecting materials</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">In order to ensure an unobstructed exhaust air flow, for the reaction module </span></p><p style="margin-left:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">the following binding minimum component dimensions are specified: </span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Width: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">1580 mm; </span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Depth: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">1350 mm;</span></p><p style="text-indent:35pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Height: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">650 mm  </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">High-performance air compressor unit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sound-insulated, highly efficient, controllable compressor unit as ready-to-connect compact device, for operation in closed air duct systems to supply the high-performance cross-flow aeration plant with process air in compressor mode</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Note: </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">The accident prevention regulation "Noise" BGV B 3 of the employers' liability insurance associations, (formerly VBG 121) are to be complied with in every case</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">with the following further properties/equipment</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Rigid [PERSON_069] mad</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">e of [PERSON_115] mat.: 1.4301 with all stiffeners and centring bolts for locking a sound box; as well as two air compressors mounted on vibration dampers; Sound box five-part, easy to assemble by means of tension latches, frame and side parts of stainless steel sheet mat.: 1.4301; inner lining of polyether foam</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> flame-retardant acc. to DIN 4102-A2; Complete automated cooling system to protect the compressor motor temperature with integrated motor fan, coupled with the compressor operation, as well as with pressure gauge integrated in sound hood; Per compressor intake and exhaust air silencer integrated in sound hood; </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Cooling system designed so that at an ambient temperature of +15° C, the inner sound box temperature of +30 °C is not exceeded at full-load operation of both compressors;  </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Precisely fitting, sound-attenuating pipe penetrations worked into the sound box to accommodate the  suction and [ORT_031]; Air compressors assembled ready for operation; Suction and compressed air lines assembled on the compressors and decoupled in a force-locking manner by means of expansion joint, ending with external connection flanges; Air compressor with drive motor as speed-controllable squirrel-cage three-phase motor of a European brand make;  Degree of protection min. IP54; Corrosion-protected shaf seal ring on stainless steel bushing;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;">Further technical details</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">(details in brackets apply to reference make)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Air compressor unit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Number of compressors:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">1 piece</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Supply voltage:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">400 V</span></p></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rated power:			 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> kW (2,2 kW)</span><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">per compressor</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Current consumption at operating point 1:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Intake volume:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">400 Nm³/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Pressure difference (dynamic) </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">50 mbar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Current consumption total:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'..............'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> A</span><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="13" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sound level max.		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'..............'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> dB(A)</span><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(max. 65 dB(A)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Current consumption at operating point 2:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Intake volume:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">300 Nm³/h</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Pressure difference (dynamic) </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">50 mbar</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="14" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Current consumption total:	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'..............'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> A</span><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="15" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sound level max.		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'..............'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> dB(A)</span><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(max. 65 dB(A)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="16" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Weight: 		 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> kg</span><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><TextComplement MarkLbl="17" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dimension: (LxBxH)	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.....................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Base frame for high-performance cross-flow aeration plant</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Sturdy steel section construction to accommodate or exactly support a single-storey cross-flow aeration plant;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">To be executed conceptually so that the operation, handling as well as the inspection work on the plant are not impaired.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Further specifications:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">All steel parts in stainless [PERSON_089] with the material no. 1.4301, manufactured in ferrite-free rooms and pickled and passivated in a full bath after processing; Packed in foil at the factory and assembled with foil;</span></p><p style="text-indent:-18pt;margin-left:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Base frame statically dimensioned accordingly for the max. fault-case weight of 22 kN; the dynamic load resulting from operation is to be taken into account;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">The permissible maximum deflection is 1/600 of the span;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">The base frame must also be sufficiently dimensioned with regard to occurring transverse forces, a 1/20 of the fault-case weight is assumed as transverse force;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Base frame with longitudinal, transverse and diagonal sections designed so that the largest possible full-surface support of the sheet metal surfaces of the modules is achieved, i.e. each reaction module is to be supported with at least three bearings; Lateral stop plates for centring and for preventing a horizontal displacement of the modules on the base frame; Sufficient number of height-adjustable sturdy feet for exact horizontal alignment of the modules; The complete steel section construction is to be delivered boltable in assmbly-friendly individual parts, welding on site is not permitted;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Manufacturer / [PERSON_129]: </span></p></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="18" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption/><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.........................................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(e.g. GfW Gesellschaft für [FIRMA_068]</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"></span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"></span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">, [ORT_028], or equivalent)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_066] incl. compressor unit</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id230" RNoPart="2"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Air filter unit of [PERSON_115] material no. 1.4571,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">vvith pipe connections on both sides and if applicable reduction of the same to DN 200 (see note further below!), spigot end,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">air throughput incl. reserve at least 900 m3 per hour (matching the compressors for the air supply of the [PERSON_066] offered above),</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">With removable cover as maintenance opening of the filters,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">all filter elements easy to check and replace,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">burst pressure of the filters 800 Pa,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">condensate drain for fresh air and clean air side with 1/2-inch external thread, for connection by others on site to a drain line,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">incl.</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Differential pressure gauge with local LCD display and potential-free connection contact for connection by others on site to the process control system (transmission of current differential pressure), including the requierd connections before/after the filter unit in the filter housing</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Air filter:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 St. fine dust filter F7 acc. to EN 779, separation efficiency &gt; 90 %</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">1 St. HEPA filter H13 acc. to EN 779, separation efficiency &gt; 99,95 %</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">incl. documentation for air filter unit</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">incl.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">wall brackets for [PERSON_162] offered:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">angle 50/50, length 450/400 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">clear wall distance 50 to 100 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">with fastening material</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">The air line to be connected on both sides is executed in nominal diameter DN 200. If the connections of the [PERSON_162] have a nominal diameter deviating from this, the reduction of the pipeline to DN 200 on both sides is to be included in the item!</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Make offered:	 </span></p></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption/><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'...........................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(Elementbau Glogger, [FIRMA_062] or</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style