h:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Fastening by means of anchor lugs in the wall reveal,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">not removable from outside,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Including adapter plate with welded-in pipe nozzle DN 200 as transition to continuing air lines.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Throughput according to the capacity of the compressors belonging to the flat-bed aerators incl. reserves: at least 900 m3/h.</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">with all required fastening material</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dimensions:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_007]: suitable for timber frame construction, total thickness approx. 20 cm.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dimensions including cover frame: all round at least 100 mm larger than "[PERSON_007]"</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Cross-section continuing air line: DN 200 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Make offered:	</span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'....................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(Glogger, [FIRMA_062] or equivalent)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Required dimensions wall opening, if the planned structural clear opening stated above is not sufficient for the maximum required air throughput:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">B x H =	 </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'...........................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"> mm</span><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Installation location: exhaust air flat-bed aerator</span></p><p sty