drill hole/of the casing pipe all round approx. 40 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">distance to the media pipe all round max. 3 mm,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">incl. all required assembly material,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">material: 1.4301</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">supply and assemble</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wall cover plate for wall penetrations up to D 200 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id312" RNoPart="61"><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wall cover plate for core drill holes / pipeline wall penetrations as before, but</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Diameter core drill hole/casing pipe:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">250 to 300 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Outside diameter media pipe:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">168 to 200 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">supply and assemble</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wall cover plate for wall penetrations up to D 300 mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id313" RNoPart="62"><Qty>5.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wall cover plate for core drill holes / pipeline wall penetrations as before, but</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Diameter core drill hole/casing pipe:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">350 to 400 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;tab-stops:48px 96px 144px 192px 240px 288px 336px 384px 432px 480px 529px 576px 624px 672px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Outside diameter media pipe:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">250 to 300 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span s