 16,</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> unless stated otherwise in the following item texts.</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Maintenance-free and corrosion-proof extended spindle seal with triple O-ring seal;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Wedge guide in the housing and long spindle bearing</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Housing: ductile cast iron EN-GJS-400-15 (GGG-40)</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bonnet: ductile cast iron EN-GJS-400-15 (GGG-40)</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Shut-off wedge: ductile cast iron EN-GJS-400-15 (GGG-40) vulcanised with EPDM on all sides</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Bonnet bolts: [PERSON_115] A2 (DIN EN ISO 3506)</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spindle: [PERSON_115] 1.4057</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Spindle nut: brass</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Corrosion protection: inside and outside epoxy coating acc. to GSK guidelines</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Tightness acc. to DIN EN 12 266-1, leakage rate A;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">all parts in contact with the medium acc. to KTW and DVGW worksheet W270 (bacteriologically harmless)</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Design with attached</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">handwheel</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Make:	</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> </span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'.........................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:112px 151px 302px 453px 604px 756px 831px 907px 982px 1058px 1104px 1152px 1200px 1248px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">([FIRMA_023] or equivalent)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_129]:			</span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'..........................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:94px 95px 113px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566p