><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Nominal diameter:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">DN 80</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Pressure rating:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">PN 16</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">supply and assemble</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gate valve DN 80, PN 16</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id338" RNoPart="3"><Qty>3.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gate valve DN 150 with handwheel</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">acc. to specification gate valve manual operation,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Nominal diameter:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">DN 150</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Pressure rating:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">PN 16</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">supply and assemble</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gate valve DN 150, PN 16</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id339" RNoPart="4"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gate valve DN 200 with handwheel</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">acc. to specification gate valve manual operation,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Nominal diameter:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">DN 200</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;tab-stops:47px 94px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">Pressure rating:</span><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">PN 10</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:397pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">supply and assemble</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Gate valve DN 200, PN 10</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Remark ID="id340"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">As far as possible, valves installed in the existing plant are reused. In the follwing items pricing is to be done accordingly:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dismantling of gate valve manually operated in the course of dismantling the existing plant pipework made of casst iron pipes</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Protection against [PERSON_010] by flushing, spray disinfection and wrapping with protective film</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Intermediate transport and storage on site</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Assembly into new plant pipework made of stainless steel pipes with renewal of the gaskets and proportionate flange fixing set</span></p></li></ul></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Specification relocate gate valve manual operation</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id341" RNoPart="5"><Qty>2.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dismantle gate valve DN 150, store temporarily, assemble,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">acc. to "Specification relocate gate valve manual operation"</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">weight approx. 35 kg</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Relocate gate valve manually operated, DN 150</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id342" RNoPart="6"><Qty>1.000</Qty><QU>St</QU><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Dismantle gate valve DN 200, store temporarily, assemble,</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">acc. to "Specification relocate gate valve manual operation"</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Weight approx. 55 kg</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Relocate gate valve manually operated, DN 200</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Remark ID="id343"><Description><CompleteText><ComplTSB>Yes</ComplTSB><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Resilient-seated centric butterfly valve acc. to DIN EN 593 Lug-Type </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">with DIN-DVGW type examination certificate for drinking water</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Shut-off valve for drinking and service water up to 100°C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DN 50 - 600, PN 10 - 16 </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Face-to-face length DIN EN 558-1, basic series 20 (DIN 3202, series K1)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Disc centric in the body, triple-supported in maintenance-free bushings;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Replaceable rubber liner with integrated seal for functionally reliable use with lap-joint flanges, welding flanges, loose flanges with V-collar and PE flanges;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_134] by liner with vulcanised carrier ring; </span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Usable as end valve for full differential pressure;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Tight in both flow directions;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Shafts blow-out proof;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Tightness acc. to DIN EN 12 266-1, leakage rate A;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Flange connection dimensions acc. to EN 1092;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">All parts in contact with the medium acc. to KTW and DVGW worksheet W270 (bacteriologically harmless);</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Body of cast iron EN-JS 1030 (GGG-40);</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Disc of [PERSON_115] 1.4408 (CF8M);</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Liner of EPDM;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Valve shaft of stainless [PERSON_089], material 1.4021;</span></p></li><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Maintenance-free shaft bearings</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Corrosion protection:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">inside and outside with epoxy coating, coating thickness &gt;250 µm, colour blue, RAL 5005</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Variants:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;text-decoration:underline ;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Operation:</span></p><ul><li><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">with hand lever up to and including DN 80</span><br/><span>with gearbox and handwheel from DN 100</span></p></li></ul><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Make: 	</span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'................................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:64px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px 708px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">([FIRMA_023] or equivalent)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="12" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">[PERSON_129]:	</span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'....................................................................'</span></ComplBody><ComplTail><br/></ComplTail></TextComplement><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:64px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px 708px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">(VAG CEREX</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;vertical-align:super;">®</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> 300-L butterfly valve</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;">or</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;tab-stops:64px 141px 188px 236px 283px 330px 378px 424px 472px 519px 566px 613px 660px 708px;"><span style="font-size:10pt;mso-tab-count:1;font-family:Arial;"> </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"> equivalent)</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">incl. all necessary fixing material (proportionate flange connection set or extra price to the flange connection proportionately contained in the flange items for gasket and longer bolts) supply and assemble ready for operation.</spa