><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">With sinking ball;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Replacement of the ball without removal of the valve;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Flange connection dimensions acc. to EN 1092-2;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Body and cover of ductile cast iron EN-GJS-400-15 (GGG-40);</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Cover bolts of [PERSON_115] A2;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Ball NBR rubber-coated;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Corrosion protection:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">inside and outside with epoxy coating in GSK design "Heavy-duty corrosion protection" acc. to </span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">DIN 30 677-2, coating thickness &gt;250 µm, colour blue, RAL 5005</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/></Text><TextComplement MarkLbl="11" Kind="Bidder"><ComplCaption><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Make: 	</span></ComplCaption><ComplBody><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">'..............................................................